<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-INDIA 2-0 V SOUTH AFRICA (235) - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 2-0 V SOUTH AFRICA (235) - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>DURBAN 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>India were 2-0 in reply to South Africa's first innings of 235 at the close on the opening day of the first test at Kingsmead on Thursday.</p>
</text>
